sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>8090/TCP HTTP
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>8085/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Detectors as Content Detectors<br/>(PII, Toxicity, Regex)
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference Server

    Note over Client,vLLM: Flow 1: Non-Streaming Chat Completion with Detection

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization header
    Gateway->>Gateway: Inject route-specific detector<br/>configuration into payload
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Forwarded Auth + X-Forwarded-* headers<br/>(optional mTLS)
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Input content detection
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator->>vLLM: Chat completion request
    vLLM-->>Orchestrator: Generated response
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Output content detection
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator-->>Gateway: OrchestratorResponse<br/>(with detections)
    alt Detection triggered
        Gateway-->>Client: Fallback message<br/>(configured per route)
    else No detection
        Gateway-->>Client: Original completion response
    end

    Note over Client,vLLM: Flow 2: Streaming Chat Completion (SSE)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>stream: true<br/>Authorization header
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Streaming request (optional mTLS)
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Content detection per chunk
    Orchestrator->>vLLM: Streaming inference
    loop SSE chunks
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: SSE data chunk<br/>(with per-chunk detections)
        alt Detection in chunk
            Gateway-->>Client: SSE chunk with fallback substitution
        else No detection
            Gateway-->>Client: SSE chunk (pass-through)
        end
    end
